      en: ["The park spans a total area of approximately 22 hectares", "The total investment for the project exceeds 100 million euros", "TBP is located just 5 minutes from the Tirana International Airport", "The buildings were constructed following strict energy efficiency standards", "More than 50 international companies have established offices here", "The park provides capacity for over 3,000 workplaces in total"],
